title: "ai-fixed-points"
abstract: >-
  An LLM-driven code improvement agent that repeatedly rewrites a piece of code
  toward a fixed point, using OpenAI-compatible models, a pluggable judge, and
  Langfuse tracing.
keywords:
  - code improvement
  - LLM agent
  - fixed point
  - pydantic-ai
  - langfuse
